{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0003-s004", "text": "Vanligtvis håller människan fast vid de saker som var viktiga för hen i den kultur som hen tidigare levt i.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063004687468+0000-2/hb-c12-u0003-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.334421768707482, "peak": 0.341827392578125, "generation_seconds": 31.624525148188695, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0003-s005", "text": "Samtidigt tillägnar hen sig nya tankar och tillvägagångssätt i den nya kulturen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063004687468+0000-2/hb-c12-u0003-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.244625850340136, "peak": 0.33709716796875, "generation_seconds": 22.285383282927796, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0004-s001", "text": "Integration betyder till exempel att en person lär sig landets språk tillräckligt bra.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063004687468+0000-2/hb-c12-u0004-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.314285714285714, "peak": 0.386322021484375, "generation_seconds": 23.041450632968917, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0004-s002", "text": "Då kan hen skapa sociala relationer, studera eller arbeta på språket.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063004687468+0000-2/hb-c12-u0004-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.199727891156463, "peak": 0.3433837890625, "generation_seconds": 18.90794393303804, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0005-s001", "text": "När man i Finland pratar om integration betonar man ofta betydelsen av att få ett arbete.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063004687468+0000-2/hb-c12-u0005-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.010884353741497, "peak": 0.30810546875, "generation_seconds": 23.578676203032956, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0005-s002", "text": "Man anser att ett arbete å ena sidan är ett mål för integrationen och å andra sidan främjar personens integration i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063004687468+0000-2/hb-c12-u0005-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.727619047619047, "peak": 0.44091796875, "generation_seconds": 35.94193030917086, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0005-s003", "text": "Genom arbetet blir personen en del av samhället och lär känna andra människor.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063004687468+0000-2/hb-c12-u0005-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.965986394557823, "peak": 0.29180908203125, "generation_seconds": 22.268855327973142, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0005-s004", "text": "Hens ekonomiska situation förbättras.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T063004687468+0000-2/hb-c12-u0005-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.6919727891156464, "peak": 0.3067626953125, "generation_seconds": 13.078493093140423, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
